Comment: 0,0:00:08.91,0:00:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不願意出賣夥伴啊
Comment: 0,0:00:11.08,0:00:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是...不是那樣 是舌頭被電麻了...
Comment: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然我並不討厭這種義氣...
Comment: 0,0:00:21.69,0:00:24.95,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(719,980)}Sisters
Comment: 0,0:00:21.69,0:00:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,調整中的妹妹們的移送應該是最後階段了...
Comment: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,突然的計畫延續以及對襲擊者的警戒
Comment: 0,0:00:30.36,0:00:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,導致內部的警備較為鬆懈
Comment: 0,0:00:34.17,0:00:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要執行「那個」
Comment: 0,0:00:35.98,0:00:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只能趁現在了!
Comment: 0,0:00:48.66,0:00:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,S-Processor 腦神經應用分析所
Comment: 0,0:00:53.02,0:00:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是...很抱歉這麼突然...
Comment: 0,0:00:56.09,0:00:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請問能否立刻趕來這邊呢?
Comment: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,詳細的情況請容我稍後說明
Comment: 0,0:01:27.87,0:01:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,和計畫有關的設施
Comment: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,超過20個喔
Comment: 0,0:01:33.93,0:01:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳打算一個人解決嗎?
Comment: 0,0:01:38.07,0:01:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳以為我是什麼人?
Comment: 0,0:01:43.25,0:01:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,既然是我播下的種
Comment: 0,0:01:46.80,0:01:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我要親手...
Comment: 0,0:01:49.59,0:01:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,收拾它...
Comment: 0,0:01:54.27,0:01:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,親手...呢
Comment: 0,0:02:37.01,0:02:40.26,Default,OP,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:04:06.97,0:04:11.81,Default,001,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:04:12.30,0:04:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,由於太過安靜了
Comment: 0,0:04:14.45,0:04:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還以為妳已經被徹底收拾乾淨了
Comment: 0,0:04:20.67,0:04:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,看來真是千鈞一髮啊
Comment: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,芙蘭達
Comment: 0,0:04:24.90,0:04:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,麥野~
Comment: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,得救了...
Comment: 0,0:04:29.07,0:04:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的
Comment: 0,0:04:31.02,0:04:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,明明說了在大家會合之前
Comment: 0,0:04:33.15,0:04:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳只要拖住她就好
Comment: 0,0:04:37.57,0:04:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,結果妳窮追不捨 結果被反咬一口還被逮住
Comment: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,都是因為妳貪圖退敵獎金導致失去判斷力
Comment: 0,0:04:44.47,0:04:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳到底在搞什麼?
Comment: 0,0:04:49.37,0:04:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒關係的 芙蘭達
Comment: 0,0:04:51.61,0:04:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我會支持這樣子的妳 芙蘭達
Comment: 0,0:04:54.39,0:04:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,「這樣」的我是怎樣...?
Comment: 0,0:05:09.42,0:05:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼
Comment: 0,0:05:10.48,0:05:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳就是傳說中的入侵者吧?
Comment: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,被擋住了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:05:14.52,0:05:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不對...
Comment: 0,0:05:15.33,0:05:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是被打飛消除了!
Comment: 0,0:05:40.89,0:05:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳還挺靈活的嘛
Comment: 0,0:05:43.56,0:05:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,竟然能黏著牆壁四處逃竄
Comment: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,簡直像蜘蛛一樣
Comment: 0,0:05:49.71,0:05:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳這傢伙...
Comment: 0,0:05:51.96,0:05:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,瀧壺
Comment: 0,0:05:59.63,0:06:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,拿去用吧
Comment: 0,0:06:09.55,0:06:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,找到了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:06:10.71,0:06:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒有 這邊沒有
Comment: 0,0:06:12.77,0:06:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那女孩 到底跑去哪了?
Comment: 0,0:06:15.83,0:06:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的
Comment: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,偏偏在這麼忙的時候...
Comment: 0,0:06:19.10,0:06:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還是聯絡一下清除者們以防萬一吧?
Comment: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,希望不要演變成麻煩的事情
Comment: 0,0:06:24.78,0:06:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你說的對
Comment: 0,0:06:42.33,0:06:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,Well
Comment: 0,0:06:43.74,0:06:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要開始了喔
Comment: 0,0:06:57.06,0:06:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,躲掉了?
Comment: 0,0:06:58.28,0:06:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不對
Comment: 0,0:06:58.96,0:07:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是電擊被強制扭曲了
Comment: 0,0:07:07.06,0:07:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,哎呀~~~好誇張啊
Comment: 0,0:07:34.23,0:07:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不妙
Comment: 0,0:07:35.77,0:07:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然不知道是怎樣
Comment: 0,0:07:37.39,0:07:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但那傢伙散發出危險的氣息
Comment: 0,0:07:53.32,0:07:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,想用障眼法嗎?
Comment: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣是爭取不了時間...
Comment: 0,0:08:00.88,0:08:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,逃走了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:08:02.75,0:08:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,瀧壺
Comment: 0,0:08:05.14,0:08:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒問題
Comment: 0,0:08:06.50,0:08:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我已經記憶了目標的AIM擴散力場
Comment: 0,0:08:14.70,0:08:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,面對那種對手以一敵三對我不利
Comment: 0,0:08:18.22,0:08:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,以破壞設施為優先
Comment: 0,0:08:22.87,0:08:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,糟糕...
Comment: 0,0:08:24.30,0:08:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,能力使用過度
Comment: 0,0:08:26.32,0:08:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒有力...
Comment: 0,0:08:31.65,0:08:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼?
Comment: 0,0:08:32.83,0:08:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我明明隨機迂迴移動了好幾次
Comment: 0,0:08:35.13,0:08:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是怎麼辦到的...
Comment: 0,0:08:36.78,0:08:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,亂猜的?
Comment: 0,0:08:40.77,0:08:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是
Comment: 0,0:08:42.42,0:08:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這是...
Comment: 0,0:08:45.46,0:08:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,被躲掉了
Comment: 0,0:08:46.73,0:08:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,搜索對象並沒有消失
Comment: 0,0:08:49.51,0:08:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是跳到天花板上嗎?
Comment: 0,0:08:52.14,0:08:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,立體的行動模式果然很麻煩啊
Comment: 0,0:08:55.44,0:08:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,瀧壺
Comment: 0,0:08:59.63,0:09:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還是一如往常的厲害...
Comment: 0,0:09:03.27,0:09:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不愧是...
Comment: 0,0:09:04.94,0:09:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,學園都市排名第四的超能力者
