Comment: 0,0:11:19.85,0:11:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也許會動搖某人的心...
Comment: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也許這麼做很愚蠢
Comment: 0,0:11:29.06,0:11:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也許這麼做...
