Comment: 0,0:15:43.79,0:15:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這傢伙怎麼處理?
Comment: 0,0:15:46.67,0:15:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,把她一起帶上去吧
Comment: 0,0:15:48.73,0:15:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,瞭解
Comment: 0,0:15:49.69,0:15:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂 站起來
Comment: 0,0:15:52.23,0:15:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,快給我走
Comment: 0,0:16:05.95,0:16:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,混...混帳...
Comment: 0,0:16:07.13,0:16:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不要動!
