Comment: 0,0:16:42.71,0:16:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我超服了妳啊
Comment: 0,0:16:45.56,0:16:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我的氮氣裝甲 這種手槍是無法貫穿的
Comment: 0,0:16:45.56,0:16:49.69,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(706,980)\fscx90}Offense Armor
Comment: 0,0:16:57.78,0:17:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請超快的把她帶上去吧
