Comment: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可惡
Comment: 0,0:17:06.03,0:17:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那邊的膠囊艙
Comment: 0,0:17:07.26,0:17:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好像有人在裡面...
Comment: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣超盯著看和工作無關的東西
Comment: 0,0:17:12.58,0:17:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可能會被超殺人滅口喔
Comment: 0,0:17:15.70,0:17:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對不起
Comment: 0,0:17:17.52,0:17:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好啦好啦 快點弄完
Comment: 0,0:17:20.95,0:17:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這傢伙會被怎麼樣?
Comment: 0,0:17:22.97,0:17:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,誰知道
Comment: 0,0:17:23.98,0:17:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我們只要把工作做超好就好
Comment: 0,0:17:27.10,0:17:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要是有利用價值 會留她一條小命吧
Comment: 0,0:17:31.70,0:17:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過
Comment: 0,0:17:33.48,0:17:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,除了性命之外 一無所有的超腐爛人生正在等著她呢
Comment: 0,0:17:53.15,0:17:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,目標距離二十公尺 朝西北方移動
Comment: 0,0:17:57.64,0:17:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,一直打不到呢
Comment: 0,0:18:00.24,0:18:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不僅是立體移動
Comment: 0,0:18:03.03,0:18:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也許是察覺到我的攻擊吧?
Comment: 0,0:18:06.55,0:18:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,擁有這種力量的能力者...
Comment: 0,0:18:08.96,0:18:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳還好嗎?
Comment: 0,0:18:11.02,0:18:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,嗯 沒事
Comment: 0,0:18:16.34,0:18:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,瀧壺的能力追蹤 雖然很方便
Comment: 0,0:18:16.34,0:18:19.06,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(891,980)}AIM stalker
Comment: 0,0:18:19.75,0:18:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但那是故意讓能力暴走所引發的失控力量
Comment: 0,0:18:24.90,0:18:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,使用上還是有極限
Comment: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,入侵者的移動距離愈來愈短了
Comment: 0,0:18:30.99,0:18:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,證實她快要到達極限了
Comment: 0,0:18:34.35,0:18:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,再繼續使用瀧壺的能力不太划算啊
Comment: 0,0:18:37.77,0:18:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,被逼到這種地步還不逃走
Comment: 0,0:18:40.68,0:18:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,表示她有拚了命也非得要破壞這設施的理由
Comment: 0,0:18:46.32,0:18:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼 只要在目的地守株待兔
Comment: 0,0:18:49.74,0:18:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她一定會出現
Comment: 0,0:18:52.83,0:18:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對方不但身心俱疲
Comment: 0,0:18:54.59,0:18:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還是缺乏冷靜的困獸
Comment: 0,0:18:57.75,0:18:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然危險 但是只要冷靜應對
Comment: 0,0:19:00.02,0:19:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就不用擔心會輸給她
Comment: 0,0:19:03.06,0:19:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是...
Comment: 0,0:19:05.83,0:19:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真不符合我的個性啊
Comment: 0,0:19:07.89,0:19:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,埋伏什麼的
Comment: 0,0:19:09.79,0:19:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,芙蘭達
Comment: 0,0:19:20.21,0:19:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,快啊 動起來 御坂美琴
Comment: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒有時間休息了...
Comment: 0,0:19:30.85,0:19:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的 好纏人!
Comment: 0,0:19:34.72,0:19:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,看招看招看招
Comment: 0,0:19:50.73,0:19:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,掰掰~ 蜘蛛女
Comment: 0,0:19:54.55,0:19:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,來了
Comment: 0,0:19:55.39,0:19:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,躲不掉!
Comment: 0,0:20:06.26,0:20:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,果然
Comment: 0,0:20:07.76,0:20:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,剛剛扭曲我的電擊的時候 就預料到了...
Comment: 0,0:20:11.55,0:20:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那傢伙的能力
Comment: 0,0:20:13.36,0:20:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,基本上跟我是同種類的
Comment: 0,0:20:17.11,0:20:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,竟然把我的原子崩壞...
Comment: 0,0:20:17.11,0:20:18.61,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1085,980)}Melt Downer
Comment: 0,0:20:22.79,0:20:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼了? 麥野
Comment: 0,0:20:30.74,0:20:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣啊
Comment: 0,0:20:32.00,0:20:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,原來如此
Comment: 0,0:20:34.05,0:20:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,等...我說 瀧壺!
Comment: 0,0:20:38.37,0:20:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒...事...吧...? 瀧...壺...
Comment: 0,0:20:44.46,0:20:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,芙蘭達
Comment: 0,0:20:45.56,0:20:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳帶著瀧壺去和絹旗會合
Comment: 0,0:20:48.88,0:20:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我...還可以繼續
Comment: 0,0:20:51.14,0:20:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這不是只為了瀧壺
Comment: 0,0:20:53.51,0:20:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,芙蘭達也被那蜘蛛女傷得很嚴重吧?
Comment: 0,0:20:57.41,0:20:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然妳在硬撐 但是動作很不順暢
Comment: 0,0:21:00.88,0:21:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,瀧壺到達極限的時候
Comment: 0,0:21:03.36,0:21:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就無法察覺到敵人的反擊
Comment: 0,0:21:06.02,0:21:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只靠我一個人保護妳們兩個
Comment: 0,0:21:09.10,0:21:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,太勉強了
Comment: 0,0:21:11.65,0:21:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對不起
Comment: 0,0:21:12.80,0:21:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,扯了妳後腿...
Comment: 0,0:21:19.21,0:21:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我不是在責罵妳喔
Comment: 0,0:21:22.21,0:21:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,反而是妳們做得真好啊
Comment: 0,0:21:25.41,0:21:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,多虧妳們兩個 對方已經奄奄一息了
Comment: 0,0:21:28.43,0:21:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,後續就交給絹旗處理
Comment: 0,0:21:30.54,0:21:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳們兩個好好休息
Comment: 0,0:21:34.77,0:21:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,麥野...
Comment: 0,0:21:36.09,0:21:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼覺得...
Comment: 0,0:21:37.76,0:21:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,剛剛好溫柔
Comment: 0,0:21:43.96,0:21:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我不想被說以多取勝啊
Comment: 0,0:21:48.40,0:21:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,學園都市排名第三的超能力者
Comment: 0,0:21:48.40,0:21:51.24,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1237,980)}Level 5
Comment: 0,0:21:52.87,0:21:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,常盤台的
Comment: 0,0:21:54.66,0:21:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,超電磁砲!
Comment: 0,0:21:54.66,0:21:55.67,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(951,980)}Railgun
Comment: 0,0:21:59.99,0:22:00.91,Default,ED,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:30.01,0:23:31.30,Default,next,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:31.29,0:23:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,常盤台的超電磁砲
Comment: 0,0:23:31.29,0:23:32.77,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1083,980)}Railgun
Comment: 0,0:23:32.85,0:23:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,來場正面決鬥如何啊?
Comment: 0,0:23:35.19,0:23:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,都已經走到了這一步...
Comment: 0,0:23:36.22,0:23:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,說不定在這段時間 她們已經...
Comment: 0,0:23:38.18,0:23:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不要來妨礙我!
Comment: 0,0:23:40.01,0:23:45.01,Default,thanks,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:45.01,0:23:47.01,staff,export,0,0,0,,
