Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.45,0:09:40.45,explaination 01,title,0,0,0,,{\pos(31,28)}{\an7\fscx0\t(0,250,2,\fscx100)\t(3750,4000,2,\fscx0)}註解  {\fs40\fnＶＤ ロゴジー 太\3c&H345761&\c&HFFFFFF&\bord\shad3}アメンボ赤いな　あいうえお
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.45,0:09:40.45,explaination 02,content,0,0,0,,{\pos(30,93)}{\an7\fscy0\t(0,250,2,\fscy100)\t(3750,4000,2,\fscy0)}「水蠅真紅啊」為北原白秋所作的「五十音」中\N第一句歌詞，這首歌常常被拿來用於發音練習。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.18,0:12:31.01,ADT,,0,0,0,,{\an1\frz-90\fs60\pos(170,372)}能力追蹤
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.18,0:12:31.01,ADT,,0,0,0,,{\fs50\fscx80\pos(286,366)}AIM Stalker
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.30,0:23:40.01,下一回,,0,0,0,,{\frz-90\an1\fs58\fscy90\pos(246,233)}原子崩壞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.30,0:23:40.01,下一回,,0,0,0,,{\fs50\fscx60\pos(352,229)}Melt Downer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.91,0:00:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不願意出賣夥伴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.08,0:00:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不是...不是那樣 是舌頭被電麻了...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然我並不討厭這種義氣...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.69,0:00:24.95,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(719,980)}Sisters
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.69,0:00:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}調整中的妹妹們的移送應該是最後階段了...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}突然的計畫延續以及對襲擊者的警戒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.36,0:00:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}導致內部的警備較為鬆懈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.17,0:00:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要執行「那個」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.98,0:00:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只能趁現在了!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.66,0:00:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}S-Processor 腦神經應用分析所
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.02,0:00:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是...很抱歉這麼突然...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.09,0:00:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請問能否立刻趕來這邊呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}詳細的情況請容我稍後說明
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.87,0:01:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}和計畫有關的設施
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}超過20個喔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.93,0:01:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳打算一個人解決嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.07,0:01:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳以為我是什麼人?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.25,0:01:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}既然是我播下的種
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.80,0:01:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我要親手...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.59,0:01:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}收拾它...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.27,0:01:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}親手...呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.30,0:04:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}由於太過安靜了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.45,0:04:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還以為妳已經被徹底收拾乾淨了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.67,0:04:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}看來真是千鈞一髮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}芙蘭達
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.90,0:04:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}麥野~
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}得救了...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.07,0:04:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.02,0:04:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}明明說了在大家會合之前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.15,0:04:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳只要拖住她就好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.57,0:04:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}結果妳窮追不捨 結果被反咬一口還被逮住
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}都是因為妳貪圖退敵獎金導致失去判斷力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.47,0:04:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳到底在搞什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.37,0:04:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒關係的 芙蘭達
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.61,0:04:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我會支持這樣子的妳 芙蘭達
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.39,0:04:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}「這樣」的我是怎樣...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.42,0:05:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.48,0:05:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳就是傳說中的入侵者吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}被擋住了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.52,0:05:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不對...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.33,0:05:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是被打飛消除了!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.89,0:05:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳還挺靈活的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.56,0:05:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}竟然能黏著牆壁四處逃竄
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}簡直像蜘蛛一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.71,0:05:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳這傢伙...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.96,0:05:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}瀧壺
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.63,0:06:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}拿去用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.55,0:06:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}找到了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.71,0:06:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒有 這邊沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.77,0:06:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那女孩 到底跑去哪了?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.83,0:06:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}偏偏在這麼忙的時候...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.10,0:06:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還是聯絡一下清除者們以防萬一吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}希望不要演變成麻煩的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.78,0:06:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你說的對
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.33,0:06:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}Well
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.74,0:06:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要開始了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.06,0:06:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}躲掉了?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.28,0:06:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不對
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.96,0:07:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是電擊被強制扭曲了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.06,0:07:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}哎呀~~~好誇張啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.23,0:07:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.77,0:07:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然不知道是怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.39,0:07:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但那傢伙散發出危險的氣息
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.32,0:07:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}想用障眼法嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣是爭取不了時間...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.88,0:08:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}逃走了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.75,0:08:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}瀧壺
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.14,0:08:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.50,0:08:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我已經記憶了目標的AIM擴散力場
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.70,0:08:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}面對那種對手以一敵三對我不利
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.22,0:08:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}以破壞設施為優先
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.87,0:08:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}糟糕...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.30,0:08:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}能力使用過度
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.32,0:08:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒有力...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.65,0:08:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.83,0:08:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我明明隨機迂迴移動了好幾次
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.13,0:08:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是怎麼辦到的...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.78,0:08:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}亂猜的?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.77,0:08:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.42,0:08:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這是...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.46,0:08:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}被躲掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.73,0:08:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}搜索對象並沒有消失
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.51,0:08:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是跳到天花板上嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.14,0:08:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}立體的行動模式果然很麻煩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.44,0:08:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}瀧壺
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.63,0:09:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還是一如往常的厲害...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.27,0:09:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不愧是...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.94,0:09:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}學園都市排名第四的超能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.94,0:09:07.49,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1238,980)}Level 5
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.22,0:09:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}原子崩壞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.22,0:09:09.39,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(960,980)}Melt Downer
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.37,0:09:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}以及
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.77,0:09:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就算逃到地球的另一端
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.87,0:09:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也能搜索到位置情報
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.81,0:09:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}瀧壺的能力追蹤
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.81,0:09:18.76,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1053,980)}AIM stalker
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.45,0:09:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}「道具」引以為傲的超能力者和大能力者的最強組合
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.45,0:09:23.15,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(381,980)}Item
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.46,0:09:23.15,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(930,980)}Level 5
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.46,0:09:23.15,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1240,980)}Level 4
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.53,0:09:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可以從這兩人手中逃脫的人...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.73,0:09:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}結果 根本迷半估啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.04,0:09:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}能出聲了!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.45,0:09:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}水蠅真紅啊 a i u e o
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.47,0:09:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然不知道她是何方神聖
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.89,0:09:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.36,0:09:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}抓到她只是時間早晚的問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.34,0:09:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}接下來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.28,0:09:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}逼得她無處可逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂美琴進行的設施襲擊...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.99,0:10:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就算她真的達成
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.73,0:10:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}計畫也不會就此停止
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.18,0:10:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}名為絕對能力者的黑暗太過晦暗 深重...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.18,0:10:13.67,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(708,980)}Level 6
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.67,0:10:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這是到現在為止研究中所收集到的人類情感資料
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.75,0:10:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}將這個安裝到她們腦中
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.72,0:10:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然我不認為這個程式的資料能讓她們產生真正的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.35,0:10:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是應該可以得到類似的反應吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.92,0:10:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然我不知道這樣能不能逼迫計畫中止
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.25,0:10:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.49,0:10:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}應該可以為她們展開一條死亡以外的路
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.51,0:10:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在將死亡視為理所當然的事接受的妹妹們中
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.51,0:10:57.19,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1389,980)}Sisters
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.87,0:11:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也許會出現悲嘆這種命運的個體
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.01,0:11:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}看到這種情形
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.79,0:11:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也許也會出現領悟到她們不僅僅是實驗動物的研究者
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.91,0:11:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}並且
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.81,0:11:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然這不太可能會發生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.76,0:11:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她們不想再繼續戰鬥下去的聲音...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.85,0:11:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也許會動搖某人的心...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也許這麼做很愚蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.06,0:11:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也許這麼做...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.03,0:11:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}根本沒有意義
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.22,0:11:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.31,0:11:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我那時感受到的心情...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.21,0:11:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}考慮妳可能是關係人 所以我向上面確認過了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.96,0:11:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}上面回覆在數據類的移送結束以前
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.75,0:11:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這裡超嚴禁出入
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.71,0:12:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然推測襲擊者為單獨犯案
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.27,0:12:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但不能忽略另一邊襲擊只是超佯攻的可能性
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.13,0:12:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因此 防衛組就算接到另一邊設施遭襲擊的報告
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.01,0:12:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也是交給游擊隊應對
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.84,0:12:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我只要超堅守自己的陣地就好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.45,0:12:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}看來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.70,0:12:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}麥野的推測似乎超準確的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.25,0:12:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}來了!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.82,0:12:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}芙蘭達
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.63,0:12:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}OK
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.99,0:12:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}結果
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.21,0:12:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在設施內先設下陷阱是正確的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.49,0:13:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}果然
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.93,0:13:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我的行蹤完全被掌握了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.29,0:13:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不會錯的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.92,0:13:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是讀心能力嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.92,0:13:08.18,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(945,980)}Psychometry
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.24,0:13:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還是透視能力?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.24,0:13:09.49,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1011,980)}Clairvoyance
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.00,0:13:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}總之...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.65,0:13:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}能鎖定我所在位置的能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.72,0:13:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就在敵方陣營!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.47,0:13:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}瞭解
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.32,0:13:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.57,0:13:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這就是所謂一面倒的情勢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.36,0:13:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.67,0:13:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請不要做無謂的掙扎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.51,0:13:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就這樣直接把妳交給委託人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.17,0:13:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}抵抗是超沒意義的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.49,0:13:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}無謂的抵抗...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.24,0:13:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}Maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.53,0:13:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.75,0:13:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}問題不只是這個計畫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.55,0:14:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就算計畫真的夭折了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.41,0:14:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}複製人可以像普通人一樣生活下去嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.55,0:14:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}人們無情的眼光...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.62,0:14:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}短暫的壽命...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.73,0:14:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}等待著她們的也許是更殘酷的命運...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.62,0:14:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}既然這樣 不如乾脆維持現狀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.01,0:14:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然如此...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.97,0:14:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不管是什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.81,0:14:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}仍一個人獨自背負著一切
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.07,0:14:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.96,0:14:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}笨蛋一個
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.13,0:14:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.09,0:14:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這本來應是我們要背負的罪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.51,0:14:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要給她們一個開拓命運的機會...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.65,0:14:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼了?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.47,0:14:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這傢伙...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.36,0:14:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒用的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.77,0:14:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}安裝已經完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.36,0:15:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她們互相透過名為「御坂網路」的腦波連結相連著
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.46,0:15:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}安裝好的感情程式
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.67,0:15:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}會由所有「妹妹們」所共有
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.67,0:15:07.85,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(992,980)}Sisters
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.29,0:15:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}已經
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.94,0:15:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒有任何人能阻止...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼 這是...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.40,0:15:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然我不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.60,0:15:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過妳的計謀似乎超失敗的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.78,0:15:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎...怎麼可能...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.63,0:15:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}什麼時候增加了這種保全系統...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.79,0:15:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這傢伙怎麼處理?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.67,0:15:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}把她一起帶上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.73,0:15:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}瞭解
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.69,0:15:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}喂 站起來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.23,0:15:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}快給我走
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.95,0:16:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}混...混帳...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.13,0:16:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不要動!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.78,0:16:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果可以 我不想用這種東西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.91,0:16:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}現在
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請你們離開
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.57,0:16:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這超不管用耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.44,0:16:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這種緊要關頭竟然還避開要害
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.71,0:16:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我超服了妳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.56,0:16:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我的氮氣裝甲 這種手槍是無法貫穿的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.56,0:16:49.69,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(706,980)\fscx90}Offense Armor
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.78,0:17:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請超快的把她帶上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.53,0:17:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是...是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.03,0:17:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那邊的膠囊艙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.26,0:17:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好像有人在裡面...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣超盯著看和工作無關的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.58,0:17:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可能會被超殺人滅口喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.70,0:17:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.52,0:17:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好啦好啦 快點弄完
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.95,0:17:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這傢伙會被怎麼樣?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.97,0:17:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}誰知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.98,0:17:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我們只要把工作做超好就好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.10,0:17:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要是有利用價值 會留她一條小命吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.70,0:17:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.48,0:17:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}除了性命之外 一無所有的超腐爛人生正在等著她呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.15,0:17:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}目標距離二十公尺 朝西北方移動
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.64,0:17:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}一直打不到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.24,0:18:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不僅是立體移動
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.03,0:18:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也許是察覺到我的攻擊吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.55,0:18:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}擁有這種力量的能力者...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.96,0:18:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳還好嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.02,0:18:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}嗯 沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.34,0:18:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}瀧壺的能力追蹤 雖然很方便
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.34,0:18:19.06,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(891,980)}AIM stalker
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.75,0:18:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但那是故意讓能力暴走所引發的失控力量
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.90,0:18:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}使用上還是有極限
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}入侵者的移動距離愈來愈短了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.99,0:18:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}證實她快要到達極限了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.35,0:18:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}再繼續使用瀧壺的能力不太划算啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.77,0:18:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}被逼到這種地步還不逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.68,0:18:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}表示她有拚了命也非得要破壞這設施的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.32,0:18:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼 只要在目的地守株待兔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.74,0:18:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她一定會出現
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.83,0:18:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對方不但身心俱疲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.59,0:18:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還是缺乏冷靜的困獸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.75,0:18:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然危險 但是只要冷靜應對
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.02,0:19:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就不用擔心會輸給她
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.06,0:19:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.83,0:19:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真不符合我的個性啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.89,0:19:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}埋伏什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.79,0:19:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}芙蘭達
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.21,0:19:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}快啊 動起來 御坂美琴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒有時間休息了...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.85,0:19:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是的 好纏人!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.72,0:19:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}看招看招看招
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.73,0:19:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}掰掰~ 蜘蛛女
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.55,0:19:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}來了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.39,0:19:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}躲不掉!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.26,0:20:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}果然
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.76,0:20:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}剛剛扭曲我的電擊的時候 就預料到了...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.55,0:20:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那傢伙的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.36,0:20:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}基本上跟我是同種類的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.11,0:20:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}竟然把我的原子崩壞...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.11,0:20:18.61,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1085,980)}Melt Downer
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.79,0:20:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼了? 麥野
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.74,0:20:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.00,0:20:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.05,0:20:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}等...我說 瀧壺!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.37,0:20:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒...事...吧...? 瀧...壺...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.46,0:20:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}芙蘭達
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.56,0:20:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳帶著瀧壺去和絹旗會合
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.88,0:20:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我...還可以繼續
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.14,0:20:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這不是只為了瀧壺
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.51,0:20:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}芙蘭達也被那蜘蛛女傷得很嚴重吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.41,0:20:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然妳在硬撐 但是動作很不順暢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.88,0:21:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}瀧壺到達極限的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.36,0:21:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就無法察覺到敵人的反擊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.02,0:21:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只靠我一個人保護妳們兩個
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.10,0:21:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}太勉強了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.65,0:21:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.80,0:21:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}扯了妳後腿...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.21,0:21:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我不是在責罵妳喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.21,0:21:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}反而是妳們做得真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.41,0:21:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}多虧妳們兩個 對方已經奄奄一息了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.43,0:21:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}後續就交給絹旗處理
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.54,0:21:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳們兩個好好休息
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.77,0:21:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}麥野...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.09,0:21:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼覺得...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.76,0:21:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}剛剛好溫柔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.96,0:21:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我不想被說以多取勝啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.40,0:21:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}學園都市排名第三的超能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.40,0:21:51.24,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1237,980)}Level 5
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.87,0:21:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}常盤台的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.66,0:21:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}超電磁砲!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.66,0:21:55.67,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(951,980)}Railgun
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.29,0:23:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}常盤台的超電磁砲
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.29,0:23:32.77,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1083,980)}Railgun
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.85,0:23:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}來場正面決鬥如何啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.19,0:23:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}都已經走到了這一步...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.22,0:23:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}說不定在這段時間 她們已經...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.18,0:23:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不要來妨礙我!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:52.19,0:02:55.69,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5}{\fscx70\fscy70\fad(300,300)\pos(961.5,979.5)}Sorrow of your heart…
Dialogue: 5,0:02:56.19,0:02:59.03,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5}{\fscx70\fscy70\fad(300,300)\pos(961.5,979.5)} I shoot it down
Dialogue: 5,0:03:37.69,0:03:40.40,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5}{\fscx70\fscy70\fad(300,300)\pos(961.5,979.5)}sister's noise…
Dialogue: 5,0:03:41.95,0:03:44.62,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5}{\fscx70\fscy70\fad(300,300)\pos(961.5,979.5)}I find it out…
Dialogue: 5,0:03:50.62,0:03:53.67,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5}{\fscx70\fscy70\fad(300,300)\pos(961.5,979.5)}Sorrow of your heart…
Dialogue: 5,0:03:54.21,0:03:57.09,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5}{\fscx70\fscy70\fad(300,300)\pos(961.5,979.5)} I shoot it down
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.35,0:02:56.86,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}姐妹電氣  不斷尋找著心中的迷惘之所
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.90,0:03:03.87,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}無人能破壞這份交織重疊的感情
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.08,0:03:13.67,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}終而復始的真相遙在遠方
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.71,0:03:19.59,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}而我卻仍未察覺到你的那份痛楚
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.84,0:03:26.97,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}即使寄託於那天的夢想將我撕碎
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.06,0:03:33.94,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}只需堅信最重要的希望便可
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.48,0:03:38.61,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}雖近在咫尺
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.69,0:03:41.90,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}卻難聞你聲
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.90,0:03:48.74,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}在時光荏苒中總算遇見了你
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.79,0:03:55.21,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}姐妹電氣  不斷尋找著心中迷惘之所
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.21,0:04:01.63,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}一定會保護好互相感受到的同一份笑容
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.67,0:04:05.59,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(300,300)}再也沒人能將其破壞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.01,0:23:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.69,0:22:17.40,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,仰望著陌生的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.82,0:22:23.24,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,總和你一起漫步
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.33,0:22:29.33,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,仿佛看見了嶄新的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.37,0:22:35.51,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,我開始追尋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.55,0:22:43.85,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,如果在迷糊的視野中迷失的話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.89,0:22:51.94,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,若觸碰到深信之心  一切將會完全改變
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.98,0:22:58.28,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,不知厭倦地細數著  而片片的雲朵卻飄向遠方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.32,0:23:03.45,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,追上前去就能找到明天的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.49,0:23:06.95,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,親眼去確認一去不返的現在吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.99,0:23:10.12,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,你所傳達的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.16,0:23:15.96,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,總有一天我也會傳達給你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.00,0:23:21.93,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,像雲朵一般  悄悄地  悄悄地
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.97,0:23:27.01,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,無論在何處  也一直  一直地
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.01,0:23:29.18,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,向前
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.01,0:23:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,
